さ、やべーの。もうピカッ！　バゴン！　って感じでさあ」"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\FFFF[1]\\AA[FFFF]　　　　　先輩：　「なんだそれ？」"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\FFFF[1]\\AA[FFFF]　　　　　部員：　「お前、しらねーの？　ティアウィスプ。この街の魔法少女だよ」"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\FFFF[1]\\AA[FFFF]　　　　　先輩：　「ああ、まあそりゃ、たまにテレビで見るからわかるけど」"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\FFFF[1]\\AA[FFFF]　　　　　部員：　「ホンモノはやべーよ。オーラが違うっていうの？　同じ人間とは思えないって"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　言うかさあ」"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\FFFF[1]\\AA[FFFF]　　　　　先輩：　「ほーん」"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　今日は部活動に顔を出してみたけど……やっぱり、きまずい。"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　なんでって、その……せんぱいと、エッチなことしちゃったし。"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\FFFF[1]\\AA[FFFF]　　　　　部員：　「あとさ、そういやあの子……」"]},{"code":205,"indent":0,"parameters":[4,{"list":[{"code":17,"indent":null},{"code":0}],"repeat":false,"skippable":false,"wait":true}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":17,"indent":null}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　わたしの方をちらっと見る。"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　この前、リリスさんがわたしの通う学園に襲撃に来たあの日……。"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\FFFF[liDe9]\\AA[FFFF]\\V[127]「魔法少女ティアスイート……もしくはユイカちゃんへ♡　わたしのところに来"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　てくださーい！　でないと今ここにいる子たち、みーんなカゲにしちゃうよ♡」"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　ばっちり私の名前を呼んでいたので、学園では「望月唯叶が魔法少女なんじゃな"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　いか」というウワサがささやかれるようになった。"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　聞かれる度に「さあ、どなたかご存知あげませんが同じ『ユイカ』って名前の別"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　人じゃないですか、わたしは魔法なんて使えないのでとてもとても……おほほほ"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　ほ……」"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　……と、見苦しい言い逃れで追及を避け続けている。"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　おかげでとっても居づらいし、何より普段のカゲ浄化じゃない人助け活動が、や"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　りにくくなってしまった。"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　そして何より……。"]},{"code":205,"indent":0,"parameters":[-1,{"list":[{"code":18,"indent":null},{"code":0}],"repeat":false,"skippable":false,"wait":true}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":18,"indent":null}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\FFFF[seSp2]\\AA[FFFF]\\V[130]「あっ……」"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　顔を真っ赤にして目を合わせられないのは、わたしもせんぱいも同じ。"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　発情のせいとはいえ、その……勢いで、えっちしちゃったんだよね、せんぱいと"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　……。"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\F[yuSp12]\\AA[F]\\V[121](ううっ、気まずいし恥ずかしいし……)"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　あの日、せんぱいのが、わたしの中に入ってきて、それで……。"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\F[yuSp27]\\AA[F]\\V[121](～～～～～っ！)"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["　　　　　　　　　頭の中に浮かんできた、あの日の感覚と思い出をふりはらう。"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\F[yuSp22]\\AA[F]\\V[121](練習、練習して気持ちをリセットしよう……)"]},{"code":221,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":201,"indent":0,"parameters":[0,142,8,6,2,0]},{"code":205,"indent":0,"parameters":[3,{"list":[{"code":39,"indent":null},{"code":37,"indent":null},{"code":0}],"repeat":false,"skippable":false,"wait":true}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":39,"indent":null}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":37,"indent":null}]},{"code":205,"indent":0,"parameters":[4,{"list":[{"code":41,"parameters":["charamob",0],"indent":null},{"code":0}],"repeat":false,"skippable":false,"wait":true}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":41,"parameters":["charamob",0],"indent":null}]},{"code":203,"indent":0,"parameters":[4,0,8,3,2]},{"code":122,"indent":0,"parameters":[320,320,0,0,2]},{"code":117,"indent":0,"parameters":[53]},{"code":230,"indent":0,"parameters":[60]},{"code":222,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\FFFF[seUn6]\\AA[FFFF]\\V[130]「…………」"]},{"code":205,"indent":0,"parameters":[4,{"list":[{"code":1,"indent":null},{"code":1,"indent":null},{"code":0}],"repeat":false,"skippable":false,"wait":true}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":1,"indent":null}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":1,"indent":null}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\FFFF[seUn7]\\AA[FFFF]\\V[130]「唯叶ちゃん」"]},{"code":205,"indent":0,"parameters":[-1,{"list":[{"code":14,"parameters":[0,0],"indent":null},{"code":19,"indent":null},{"code":0}],"repeat":false,"skippable":false,"wait":true}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":14,"parameters":[0,0],"indent":null}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":19,"indent":null}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\FFFF[seUn7]\\F[yuUn18]\\AA